     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formation",
     "texto": [
      "It is formed with the future (the stem) + the imperfect endings: **-ais, -ais, -ait, -ions, -iez, -aient**.",
      "Example: **je pourrais** (I could), **nous voudrions** (we would want), **ils seraient** (they would be)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What it is used for",
     "texto": [
      "To ask politely: **Je voudrais** (you already know it).",
      "For something possible or a wish: **Je ferais le voyage** (I would make the trip).",
      "To give advice: **Tu devrais dormir** (you should sleep)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
